#: ../../../scripting/launch_types.rst:15
msgid "Launch Types"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/launch_types.rst:17
msgid "There are two execution types for extra scripts:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/launch_types.rst:19
msgid "**PRE** - executes before the main script of :ref:`platforms`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/launch_types.rst:21
msgid ""
"Useful to pre-generate extra source files or make dynamic changes/patches to "
"the existing, pass flags to the global building environment, add :ref:"
"`scripting_middlewares`, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/launch_types.rst:26
msgid ""
"Please note that the ``projenv`` (see :ref:`scripting_envs`) is not "
"available at this stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/launch_types.rst:29
msgid ""
"**POST** - executes after the **PRE** and the main script of :ref:"
"`platforms`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/launch_types.rst:32
msgid ""
"The building environment is fully constructed at this stage with all build "
"flags, development platform targets, dependent libraries, and ``projenv``. "
"Useful to assign :ref:`scripting_actions`, modify default build flags set by "
"the development platform, or extend the building workflow."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/launch_types.rst:38
msgid ""
"The extra scripts can be configured using the :ref:"
"`projectconf_extra_scripts` option in :ref:`projectconf` or using the :ref:"
"`library_json_buid_extra_script` in :ref:`library_json` manifest."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/launch_types.rst:42
msgid ""
"The launch type can be specified as a prefix (``pre:`` or ``post:``) to the "
"script path. If there is no prefix specified, the ``post:`` will be used "
"automatically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/launch_types.rst:46
msgid "**Example**"
msgstr ""

